						"acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Vectis Mail is a self-hosted email server you run on your own VPS — Postfix, Dovecot, and Rspamd packaged with a REST API, a React admin UI, and an atomic update orchestrator. It replaces the email half of Microsoft 365 (the Exchange Online mailboxes), giving you full IMAP/SMTP mailboxes, your own domains, DKIM/SPF/DMARC, and webmail for a flat price instead of per-user-per-month licensing. It does not replace Office apps (Word, Excel, PowerPoint) or Teams — those are a separate need." }
